From 88bdf2fe1f569afd52564cd3e60a6e9154b492fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:01:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] debug_tools: NX2NAVI_MARK_RECIPE (default 1; 0 off, 2 also a
 raw .probe) writes a recipe at every mark and shot.req,
 logs/mark-<present>.dbg (NX2NAVI_MARK_DIR elsewhere): area, Link's position,
 age, free camera, speed and every scalar and 4-byte-array game data value, so
 a lab run recreates the moment from a neutral save; test-script commands mark
 and camset

---
 runtime/boot.c        |  34 +++++++++-
 runtime/debug_tools.c | 147 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 runtime/debug_tools.h |   9 ++-
 3 files changed, 187 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/runtime/boot.c b/runtime/boot.c
index 2b00a3d..b6d9b7a 100644
--- a/runtime/boot.c
+++ b/runtime/boot.c
